	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Es<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>t e<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nim <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>satis ea i<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>n re <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>pusi<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>llanimis <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>her<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>us.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ad hoc proceres <placeName ref="l1273">Ensesheimenses</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>18. septembris huc venientes nomine Caesaris mandarunt, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>pelleret ex valle, ut vocant, <persName>Alberthi</persName> omnes <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>anabaptistas, hoc quod factum est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Deinde ut <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>me, omnium hęreticorum pessimum Zvinglianistam item <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>et Calvinistam exigeret oppido, postremo ne dis<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>cedat vel ad latum digitum a maiorum religione <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>et ecclesia, ut vocant, catholica scilicet.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Vides ergo, optime <lb xml:id="p1z17"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, imo tenes, quo res meę evaserint <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>qualique sim in discrimine: aut mihi emigrandum <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>aut baroni mea pręsentia periculum accersendum.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Pollicetur defensionem, sed vix poterit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Habet con<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>siliarios nobiles, cancellarium ac reliquos proceres <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>non admodum studiosos pietatis, qui inconstantes <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>metuunt, ne coelum ruat.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Si mihi omnino mi<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>grandum fuerit, concedam <placeName ref="l335">Mylhusium</placeName> etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Dominus <persName>Nicolaus</persName> adhuc satis molestę decumbit <placeName>Huna<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ville</placeName>, ubi et <persName>Götzius</persName> noster adhuc hęret.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Sunt <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>illic tutiores atque ego.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Hinc ego solus sum, de <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>cuius capite propemodum agitur, neque etiam mei <placeName ref="l572">Wirtenber<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>gici</placeName> cessant persequi occasionem quęrentes, quo me spolient <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>tutorum principum munificentia, qua meę senectuti <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>providerant.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">At paratus sum, non turbatus, nudus <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>homo exilii, sub terram nudus abibo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Atque ut sua stabiliant, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>mendaciter in me cudunt huius dissipationis <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>fabam, denique me absente respublica multo <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>crudelius tumultuatur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Nuper celebrarunt coenam, sed <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>ex tanta frequentia tantum octo, qui tamen proceres sunt, <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>communicarunt.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Negotium ad tutores nunc relatum est <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>per <placeName ref="l2481">Svevum</placeName> concionatorem; putant eos, qui sunt <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>senatores et amplissimi ordinis, cum a biennio excepto <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>uno non communicarint, excommunicandos aut ab <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>offitio removendos etc.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><persName>Rudolphus Baucus</persName> coactus <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>est relinquere suam ecclesiam quorundam consilio, <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>dum vulgus sedetur.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Vir pius est, doctus et honestę <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>vitę cum familia.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><persName>Petrus Hoqqerus</persName> cum suis conspi<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>ratoribus solus regnat in insulis fortunatis etc. <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>homo sibi sapiens altique supercilii etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">O tempora, o <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>mores, ego video nullo consilio huic malo posse <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>mederi, adeo furit Satan, nisi quod benignissimi <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>dei patris aures continuis precibus per Iesum Christum <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>pulsandę, ne suę causę desit.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Admonendus <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>populus, qui in summo luxu vivit, ad vitę resipiscentiam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z22"/>Sed ubi sunt, qui id muneris obeant?</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Vides ergo <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>omnia deplorata esse.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Hęc ad te paucis, doctissime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>ne ignorares nostras calamitates, quem oro propter <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>dei filium, ut nos commendes publicis precibus vestrę <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>ecclesię.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Sumus in magno periculo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Ego oro: "Sufficit <lb xml:id="p2z27"/>mihi; tolle, queso, animam meam."</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Fiat domini voluntas.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z28"/>Amen.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Vale in Iesu Christo cum tua familia <lb xml:id="p2z29"/>ac sanctis fratribus, quos nominatim salutabis.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p2z30"/>Salutat te pia et sancta matrona, quę inter tot <lb xml:id="p2z31"/>pericula anxiatur, sed non despondet animum etc.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z32"/><placeName ref="l404">Rappolsvillę</placeName> 5. die octobris 1561.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z33"/>T[uus] <persName ref="p1010">Matthias Erbius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p4676">Egenolphus</persName> cum ux<lb xml:id="p2z34"/>ore iam per quattuo<lb xml:id="p2z35"/>rdecim dies in nuptiis d. <lb xml:id="p2z36"/><persName>Philippi</persName> a <placeName ref="l2313">Hanau</placeName> pergręcatur etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z37"/>Quid velim, intelligis<lb xml:id="p2z38"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Viro inprimis pietate <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>ac eruditione eximio <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p4z4"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> ecclesię <lb xml:id="p4z5"/>anti<lb xml:id="p4z6"/>stiti, suo domino <lb xml:id="p4z7"/>observando.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p4z8"/><placeName ref="l587">Zurch</placeName> etc.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
